    Ctrl-R   fuzzy history
    Ctrl-T   fuzzy file → insert path
    Alt-C    fuzzy directory → cd
  Inside any fzf picker
    type to filter · ↑/↓ or Ctrl-J/K · Enter select · Esc cancel
  PowerShell
    Ctrl-R   PSReadLine history search
    bins     fuzzy pick a command on PATH (needs fzf)

Navigation (zoxide)
  z src          jump to frecent dir matching "src"
  z proj app     match multiple tokens
  zi             interactive picker (also uses fzf if present)
  (no cd override — plain cd still works)

Tool versions & runtimes (mise)
  mise ls / mise ls-remote <tool>
  mise install                install tools from global config / project mise.toml
  mise exec -- <cmd>          run with project tool versions
  Global pins: python, node, bun, omp, agy-crew, copier, rg, fd, delta, zoxide,
               just, uv, yq, fnox, rbw (Linux) / bw (Win), betterleaks
  Optional toolsets (.chezmoidata.toml): infra (tofu, kubectl), containers (helm), rust
  Profiles: workstation (default), server (no AI tools), ephemeral (containers)

Repo task runner (just) — from mydotfiles checkout
  just                        list repo recipes
  just check | test           run full CI suite (scripts/ci-check.sh)
  just test-fast              CI suite skipping network checks
  just apply / diff / update  chezmoi against this checkout
  just render-rules           render agent-core.md → agent/cursor-user-rules.md
  just scan-secrets           run betterleaks git scan
  just install-hooks          install pre-commit hooks
  just dots                   print this cheat sheet

Global agent & project runner (just -g) — from any directory
  just -g                     list global recipes (~/.justfile)
  just -g doctor              audit env, active stack, version pins, vault & secrets
  just -g seed [lang] [arch]  scaffold AGENTS.md + .agent-profile.md
                              seeds: python, typescript-node, systems-shell, minimal
                              archetypes: infra-ops, agent-cli, data-pipeline, legacy-port
  just -g agent-init [arch]   attach .agent-profile.md to current repo
  just -g omp-wt <br> [args]  named-branch worktree + omp inside (wt switch -x)
  just -g worktree-new <br>   create sibling worktree ../wt-<br>
  just -g worktree-done <br>  remove clean sibling worktree

Agent worktree lifecycle
  omp                       native session worktree (onStart=create, onExit=ask)
                            OMP_NO_WT=1 omp → run in current checkout
  claude / devin            auto-worktree via wt switch -x; exit prompts
                            keep / rename / discard (AGENT_WT_ASK=0 disables)
  AGENT_BRANCH=<br> claude  resume existing branch into a fresh worktree
  wta [harness]             pick a worktree/branch → launch session inside
  wtr <br> [harness]        review a finished agent branch (log, diff, bus note)
  wtpull [--copy] [src]     move another worktree's uncommitted changes in
  inside omp: /wt <br>      relocate live session into a worktree
              /wt-name <br> rename current branch mid-session
              /wt-switch <br>   check out another branch in place
              /wt-pull [--copy]   move root checkout's uncommitted work in
              /wt-merge [-m msg]  commit + merge to default branch (keeps wt)
              /wt-keep · /wt-drop   pre-set exit policy for the wrapper
              /wt-status    branch · root · commits ahead · dirty · policy

omp Power-User Guide (TUI, Subagents, URIs & Tools)
  TUI & Session Control
    ? or /btw <q>             side-question panel without interrupting active turn
    /tan                      clone current session into a parallel side-agent
    /wt [branch]              move live omp session into an isolated git worktree
    /context                  inspect token usage by system prompt, tools & turns
    /resume | omp --continue  reopen recent session across repo worktrees
  Subagent Delegation (say "parallelize across subagents" or invoke by role)
    scout                     fast read-only codebase exploration (saves main context)
    task                      full multi-step implementation worker (up to 32 parallel)
    reviewer | security-reviewer  evidence-backed diff / vulnerability audit
    seance                    query a past session transcript without loading it inline
  Built-in Internal URIs (usable in read, grep, glob, write, bash)
    pr://<N>/diff             read GitHub PR diff (or issue://<N> for issues)
    ssh://host/~/path         read/write/grep remote UTF-8 files over SSH directly
    file.db:table?q=SELECT..  inspect SQLite tables/queries directly via read
    archive.zip:member/path   inspect/write inside ZIP/tar/deb/whl archives directly
  Code Intelligence & Eval Kernel
    xd://lsp                  definitions, references, hover, rename (prefer over grep)
    xd://ast_edit             syntax-aware structural codemods & refactors
    xd://debug                attach DAP debugger to inspect failing test frames
    eval (py / js)            stateful Python & Bun kernel + headless Chromium (browser)
    agy-crew                  /agy-crew-ask, /agy-crew-reviewer, /agy-crew-implementer

